<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Apple Wallet in iOS 27 &#8211; Bill Splitting and Custom Passes</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Video · August 12 · all tiers</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">iOS 27 finally does bill splitting, and I&#8217;ve been using it under fire. Point the camera at the receipt, check off what you ate, and either request money from your friend or send your share. Wallet also lets you build your own passes now, by hand or by pointing the camera at a card.</p>



